config SDHC_RK_DW_MSHC
	bool "Rockchip RK3566 SD 컨트롤러 (DesignWare MSHC, PIO + IDMAC)"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_ROCKCHIP_RK3568_DW_MSHC_ENABLED
	select SDHC_SUPPORTS_NATIVE_MODE
	help
	  sdmmc0 @0xfe2b0000. U-Boot dw_mmc.c 의 FIFO 경로 + IDMAC 디스크립터 링(TF-A dw_mmc.c).
